00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:16.860
But... I'm still one of the daughters of the main family, you know.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.650
I can cope easily.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.470
S-Sis...

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.650
Well, besides that,

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:27.520
Maybe there's a survivor from your family who knows the technique.

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:31.690
Chichinagare can also share tits right?

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:37.860
When you learn it, come back and give me my tits, understand?

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.200
Y-Yes...

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:40.670
Let's go, Kokage.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:41.760
Okay!

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:43.880
Sis!

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:56.520
Is that from the village?

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:59.450
What is the next interesting story?

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:01.830
Kagefusa failed.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.780
Really? That mad dog?

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:08.700
Sis... She's my real sister...

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:11.020
A dog is still a dog!

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:13.130
She wags her tail in front of father and

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:15.260
bares her fangs towards the people.

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:19.730
And... what are you going to do now?

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:22.420
Ouka!

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:23.650
Yes...

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:24.790
Go!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:25.940
Ok...

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:12.800
<i>They part ways with Kagefusa.</i>

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:16.280
<i>Chifusa and Kaede made their decision and continued their journey to Munamori Village.</i>

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:19.080
<i>But another Assassin appeared in their path.</i>

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:25.380
<i>Boing, hey Chifusa-sama, your tits got to max size and I think you're in trouble now.</i>

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:27.700
<i>Oh... there's an inn over there!</i>

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:30.820
<i>Next on Manyuu Hikenchou, Boobie Kid!</i>

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:33.390
<i>If there are tits you throw away, there are also ones you can pick up.</i>

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:34.590
<i>Don't throw it!</i>
